WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.291
Wagatijan tɛmɛnin kɔ, sanni siradaw ka tɛmɛ jamana kɔnɔ, jagokɛla dɔ tagara yiritu dɔ kɔnɔ, Ouagadougou tileben fan fɛ.

00:00:10.371 --> 00:00:17.350
Lon o lon, a tun b'a fɛ ka taga sogo nɔgbɛn fɔ yɔrɔjan, fɔ k'a yɛrɛ mabɔ sira ra.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:20.139
Sanjiginan tun be dugukolo jɛni.

00:00:20.219 --> 00:00:28.243
A ka fani min don a ra, o tun lakolon lo kabini wagatijan, a senw fana tun tɛ se k'a ta tuun.

00:00:28.323 --> 00:00:32.862
A tun lanin b'a la ko a tɛna a ka dugumɔgɔw ye tugun.

00:00:32.942 --> 00:00:36.435
O tuma na, kongosogo dɔ bɔra binjanw kan.

00:00:36.515 --> 00:00:38.265
O kɔ, a y'a ɲaa tugu.

00:00:38.345 --> 00:00:40.183
Nka, a ma se k'a faga.

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:46.457
A lɔra ka ɲa dɔɔnin, ka nimisa, ka yɛlɛma k'a fɔ a ye ko a ye tugu a kɔ.

00:00:46.537 --> 00:00:53.691
O kɔ, jagokɛbaga wurira ka tugu a kɔ, ka taga se fɔ dingakɔnɔba dɔ ra, yiriw kɔ fɛ.

00:00:53.771 --> 00:00:58.048
O kɔ, a ka duvɛn min, ka nɛnɛkiri, ka baraka sɔrɔ.

00:00:58.128 --> 00:01:03.277
Cɛɛ segira ka na a ka somɔgɔw fɛ k'a ka koo bɛɛ lakali u ye.

00:01:03.357 --> 00:01:16.437
A fɔra o lon na ko Ala ka jɛnɲɔgɔnya don ni o ye, ko Sabɔ dugumɔgɔw tɛna sɔn ka tɔrisenw faga, ko tɔrisesenw tɛna sɔn k'a to o ye Sabɔ dugu mɔgɔw faga.

00:01:16.517 --> 00:01:20.620
Hali bi, u b'o kongosogow jati fɛɛn senumanw ye.

00:01:20.700 --> 00:01:26.284
O kɔ, u y'a fɔ ko ni kongosogo dɔ sara, u b'a bonya i ko mɔgɔ dɔ.

00:01:26.364 --> 00:01:30.816
Mɔgɔ dɔw be na bɔ u ye ani dugumɔgɔw be taga n'u ye.

00:01:30.896 --> 00:01:32.821
U b'u ka kokɛcogow lɔn.

00:01:32.901 --> 00:01:47.723
Ni mɔgɔkɔrɔbaw b'o kibaroya fɔra denmisɛnw ye, u be laban o cogo kelen na tuma bɛɛ: Mɔgɔ tɛ ɲinɛ koɲuman dɔ kɔ, ani a tigi be se ka barika la Ala ye ka tɛmɛ a sii bɛɛ kan.
